# Browser
# What a player sees of banding as the defender (CR 702.22j): Bot2's Ulvenwald Oddity (4/4 trample) attacks Bot1, who blocks
# it with Benalish Hero and Guerrilla Gorilla. In the damage step Bot1's page is asked to divide the Oddity's damage - the
# dock says it is the opponent's creature's, by banding - among Bot1's own blockers, with no share for any player: all 4 on
# the Hero, the Gorilla dealt nothing, Bot1 dealt nothing.

